8,"Documentation of Baskeet song, verbal art and ceremonial language",https://www.elararchive.org/dk0253/,"The collection of music-/song-related recordings is supplemented by a corpus (non-musical) narratives and elicited language material (lexicon, paradigms, example sentences). The data was collected by the linguist Yvonne Treis.",Me’en,Nilo-Saharan
